    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8b0644f0-fc8f-303d-8e85-ecf2cdb513ac",
                "word": "gambol",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fc154f62-08ef-4042-9186-229242e277fd",
                        "entry_id": "8b0644f0-fc8f-303d-8e85-ecf2cdb513ac",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "gambols"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec5bcea6-07a5-3dfe-a305-6e375447f7d8",
                        "entry_id": "8b0644f0-fc8f-303d-8e85-ecf2cdb513ac",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instance of running or skipping about playfully."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d33f10a-697b-4c0f-aa5a-69fa2d5b9654",
                                "sense_id": "ec5bcea6-07a5-3dfe-a305-6e375447f7d8",
                                "text": "Heere hung those lipps, that I haue kist I know not how oft. VVhere be your Iibes now? Your Gambals? Your Songs? Your flashes of Merriment that were wont to set the Table on a Rore?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c454560-2b4a-4dbf-9ef2-a836405ce22c",
                                "sense_id": "ec5bcea6-07a5-3dfe-a305-6e375447f7d8",
                                "text": "When his gambols were over, I looked at the paper, and, to speak the truth, found myself not a little puzzled at what my friend had depicted."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c332f34c-f233-35bc-8b6a-b16b57df6f2a",
                        "entry_id": "8b0644f0-fc8f-303d-8e85-ecf2cdb513ac",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instance of more general frisking or frolicking."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16618456-6cba-4cee-bd4b-29176e240822",
                                "sense_id": "c332f34c-f233-35bc-8b6a-b16b57df6f2a",
                                "text": "There was a delicious sensation of mingled security and awe with which I looked down, from my giddy height, on the monsters of the deep at their uncouth gambols."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3910e672-5742-4e9f-bc5e-b7fec4e04a3e",
                                "sense_id": "c332f34c-f233-35bc-8b6a-b16b57df6f2a",
                                "text": "The season of salad days has been rightly called a season of folly—rightly, because nature wisely intended salad days for folly, and we are wise to regard them as a time for folly. But are we wise when, halting upon the crutches age finds convenient after the gambols of youth have lost their attractions, we condemn this season of harmless folly to perpetual reprobation?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "be95572c-2ecc-416e-b3b4-9a131ce3269a",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b0644f0-fc8f-303d-8e85-ecf2cdb513ac",
                        "source_sense_description": "instance",
                        "target_lang_word": "gambade",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gambade",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "832c077d-0f09-3a73-8784-2f0ddacfb464",
                                        "entry_id": "f6a6d027-a63e-3396-a476-acdebc9a3f7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Saut vif et sans règle qui dénote de la gaieté, de l’entrain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a017d4-4652-45a4-b419-dd2faf11fdbf",
                                                "sense_id": "832c077d-0f09-3a73-8784-2f0ddacfb464",
                                                "text": "Après avoir fait gambades sur gambades, exécuté des voltiges hardies autour de sœur Rose très émue, fait niches sur niches et mille agaceries aux militaires qui jouaient à la drogue et dont les pinces en bois posées sur le nez des perdants me faisaient toujours rire, j'étais, on le pense, très animé, très emporté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2aa6aa9-2c36-457f-ad02-e9820658ac3c",
                                                "sense_id": "832c077d-0f09-3a73-8784-2f0ddacfb464",
                                                "text": "Et, en dessous, une ligne qui aurait voulu être horizontale, mais qui délirait en hauteur, s'élevait comme une gambade."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baf7d61c-ef9a-498e-9a7d-b56804c7c8ed",
                                                "sense_id": "832c077d-0f09-3a73-8784-2f0ddacfb464",
                                                "text": "Puis arriva une troupe de jeunes chrétiennes très peu vêtues, qui dansèrent et firent toutes sortes de gambades."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd1e39b0-61d9-4e56-be03-21ccec3873e9",
                                                "sense_id": "832c077d-0f09-3a73-8784-2f0ddacfb464",
                                                "text": "J’ai graissé la patte au berger\nPour lui faire jouer une aubade\nLors, ma mie, sans croire au danger\nFaisons mille et une gambades."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "gambade",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
